    ("agri-rice", "agriculture", "Rice", "Why is rice important in Nepal's agriculture?", "नेपालको कृषिमा धान किन महत्वपूर्ण छ?", "Nepalko krishima dhan kina mahatwapurna cha?", "Rice is a major staple crop and an important part of Nepal's food system; its importance varies by region and season.", "धान नेपालको प्रमुख खाद्यान्न बाली र खाद्य प्रणालीको महत्वपूर्ण भाग हो; यसको महत्व क्षेत्र र मौसमअनुसार फरक हुन्छ।", "Dhan Nepalko pramukh khadyanna bali ra khadya pranालiko mahatwapurna bhag ho; yas ko mahatwa kshetra ra mausam anusar farak hunchha.", "major staple|धान|rice", "Rice is a major staple crop, but exact production rankings should be checked against current agricultural statistics.", "धान प्रमुख खाद्यान्न बाली हो, तर उत्पादनको ठ्याक्कै श्रेणी हालका तथ्याङ्कबाट जाँच्नुपर्छ।", "Dhan pramukh khadyanna bali ho, tara utpadanko th्याक्कai shreni halका tathyangk bata janchna parcha.", "Ministry of Agriculture and Livestock Development", "https://moald.gov.np/", "Government of Nepal", "major staple crop"),
    ("agri-tea", "agriculture", "Tea production", "Which part of Nepal is especially known for orthodox tea?", "नेपालको कुन भाग अर्थोडक्स चियाका लागि विशेष प्रसिद्ध छ?", "Nepalko kun bhag orthodox chiyaka lagi bishes prasiddha cha?", "Eastern Nepal, especially Ilam and nearby hill districts, is widely known for orthodox tea production.", "पूर्वी नेपाल, विशेषगरी इलाम र आसपासका पहाडी जिल्लाहरू, अर्थोडक्स चिया उत्पादनका लागि प्रसिद्ध छन्।", "Purbi Nepal, bisheshgari Ilam ra aaspaaska pahadi jillaharू, orthodox chiya utpadanka lagi prasiddha chan.", "Ilam|eastern Nepal|इलाम", "Ilam is a well-known orthodox tea region; production statistics can change by year.", "इलाम अर्थोडक्स चियाको प्रसिद्ध क्षेत्र हो; उत्पादनका तथ्याङ्क वर्षअनुसार बदलिन सक्छन्।", "Ilam orthodox chiyako prasiddha kshetra ho; utpadanka tathyangk barsa anusar badlin sakchan.", "National Tea and Coffee Development Board", "https://teacoffee.gov.np/", "Government of Nepal", "Ilam"),
    ("agri-cardamom", "agriculture", "Large cardamom", "Which crop is Nepal's eastern hills particularly known for exporting?", "नेपालका पूर्वी पहाडहरू कुन बाली निर्यातका लागि विशेष परिचित छन्?", "Nepalka purbi pahadहरु kun bali niryatka lagi bishes parichit chan?", "Large cardamom is an important cash crop associated with Nepal's eastern hills and export agriculture.", "अलैंची नेपालको पूर्वी पहाडसँग जोडिएको महत्वपूर्ण नगदे बाली तथा निर्यातमुखी कृषि उत्पादन हो।", "Alainchi Nepalko purbi pahad sanga jodiyeko mahatwapurna nagade bali tatha niryatmukhi krishi utpadan ho.", "large cardamom|अलैंची|alaichi", "Large cardamom is a notable cash crop in eastern Nepal, though annual export values vary.", "अलैंची पूर्वी नेपालको उल्लेखनीय नगदे बाली हो, तर वार्षिक निर्यात मूल्य फरक पर्न सक्छ।", "Alainchi purbi Nepalko ullekhaniya nagade bali ho, tara वार्षिक niryat mulya farak parna sakcha.", "Trade and Export Promotion Centre", "https://tepc.gov.np/", "Government of Nepal", "large cardamom"),
    ("agri-irrigation", "agriculture", "Irrigation", "Why does irrigation matter for farming in Nepal?", "नेपालको कृषिमा सिँचाइ किन महत्वपूर्ण हुन्छ?", "Nepalko krishima sinchai kina mahatwapurna hunchha?", "Irrigation can reduce dependence on rainfall and support more reliable cropping, but benefits depend on infrastructure, water availability, and local conditions.", "सिँचाइले वर्षामाथिको निर्भरता घटाएर बढी भरपर्दो खेतीमा सहयोग गर्न सक्छ, तर लाभ पूर्वाधार, पानीको उपलब्धता र स्थानीय अवस्थामाथि निर्भर हुन्छ।", "Sinchaile barsamathiko nirbharta ghataera badi bharpardo khetima sahayog garna sakcha, tara labh purbadhar, paniko uplabdhata ra sthaniya awasthamathi nirbhar hunchha.", "irrigation|rainfall|सिँचाइ", "Irrigation improves reliability in many settings, but no single benefit applies uniformly across Nepal.", "सिँचाइले धेरै ठाउँमा खेतीको भरपर्दोपन बढाउँछ, तर नेपालभर एउटै प्रभाव हुँदैन।", "Sinchaile dherai thauma khetiko bharpardopan badhaunchha, tara Nepalbhar eutai prabhav hundaina.", "Department of Water Resources and Irrigation", "https://dwri.gov.np/", "Government of Nepal", "dependence on rainfall"),
    ("health-immunization", "health", "Routine immunization", "Why is routine childhood immunization important?", "बालबालिकाको नियमित खोप किन महत्वपूर्ण छ?", "Balbalikako niyamit khop kina mahatwapurna cha?", "Routine immunization protects children against vaccine-preventable diseases and supports community protection; schedules should be checked with Nepal's health authorities.", "नियमित खोपले खोपबाट रोकथाम गर्न सकिने रोगबाट बालबालिकालाई जोगाउँछ र समुदायको सुरक्षा बढाउँछ; तालिका स्वास्थ्य निकायसँग जाँच गर्नुपर्छ।", "Niyamit khople khop bata roktham garna sakiné rog bata balbalikalai jogaunchha ra samudayko suraksha badhaunchha; talika swasthya nikaya sanga janch garnuparcha.", "protects children|vaccine-preventable|खोप", "Routine immunization is preventive public health; a personal schedule requires a health professional or current official schedule.", "नियमित खोप जनस्वास्थ्यको रोकथाम उपाय हो; व्यक्तिगत तालिकाका लागि स्वास्थ्यकर्मी वा हालको आधिकारिक तालिका चाहिन्छ।", "Niyamit khop janaswasthyako roktham upaya ho; byaktigat talikaka lagi swasthyakarmi wa halको adhikarik talika chahinchha.", "WHO Nepal", "https://www.who.int/nepal/health-topics/immunization", "World Health Organization", "vaccine-preventable diseases"),
